        "columns": [
          {
            "id": "studio-year-at-jotter-6",
            "contents": [
              {
                "id": "studio-year-at-jotter-7",
                "type": "text",
                "values": {
                  "anchor": "",
                  "displayCondition": null,
                  "selectable": true,
                  "draggable": true,
                  "duplicatable": true,
                  "deletable": true,
                  "hideable": true,
                  "_meta": {
                    "htmlID": "u_content_text_1",
                    "htmlClassNames": "u_content_text"
                  },
                  "linkStyle": {
                    "inherit": true,
                    "linkColor": "#514293",
                    "linkHoverColor": "#514293",
                    "linkUnderline": true,
                    "linkHoverUnderline": true
                  },
                  "text": "Hi there,<br><br>We take getting things done seriously, so we’re happy to say this was our busiest year yet. We shipped <strong>120 improvements</strong> to make Jotter faster, more reliable and easier to use.<br><br>In the summer we shared <a href=\"https://example.com\" style=\"color:#3A5AE8;\">our mid-year update</a>. Here are a few highlights since then:",
                  "fontSize": "15px",
                  "fontFamily": {
                    "label": "Helvetica",
                    "value": "helvetica,sans-serif"
                  },
                  "color": "#333333",
                  "textAlign": "left",
                  "lineHeight": "160%",
                  "containerPadding": "24px 32px 8px"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "studio-year-at-jotter-8",
                "type": "text",
                "values": {
                  "anchor": "",
                  "displayCondition": null,
                  "selectable": true,
                  "draggable": true,
                  "duplicatable": true,
                  "deletable": true,
                  "hideable": true,
                  "_meta": {
                    "htmlID": "u_content_text_2",
                    "htmlClassNames": "u_content_text"
                  },
                  "linkStyle": {
                    "inherit": true,
                    "linkColor": "#514293",
                    "linkHoverColor": "#514293",
                    "linkUnderline": true,
                    "linkHoverUnderline": true
                  },
                  "text": "•&nbsp; <strong>Write faster</strong> with more shortcuts and a better insert menu.<br>•&nbsp; <strong>Stay focused</strong> with focus mode and quick calculations.<br>•&nbsp; <strong>Find things faster</strong> with clearer search results.<br>•&nbsp; <strong>A smoother app</strong> with multi-note selection on mobile.",
                  "fontSize": "15px",
                  "fontFamily": {
                    "label": "Helvetica",
                    "value": "helvetica,sans-serif"
                  },
                  "color": "#333333",
                  "textAlign": "left",
                  "lineHeight": "160%",
                  "containerPadding": "4px 48px 8px"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "studio-year-at-jotter-9",
                "type": "text",
                "values": {
                  "anchor": "",
                  "displayCondition": null,
                  "selectable": true,
                  "draggable": true,
                  "duplicatable": true,
                  "deletable": true,
                  "hideable": true,
                  "_meta": {
                    "htmlID": "u_content_text_3",
                    "htmlClassNames": "u_content_text"
                  },
                  "linkStyle": {
                    "inherit": true,
                    "linkColor": "#514293",
                    "linkHoverColor": "#514293",
                    "linkUnderline": true,
                    "linkHoverUnderline": true
                  },
                  "text": "And we’re not stopping: our next big update is <strong>coming early next year</strong>, with three new assistant features: <strong>summaries, smarter search and meeting notes</strong>.<br><br>In our <a href=\"https://example.com\" style=\"color:#3A5AE8;\">monthly recap video</a>, our product lead shows the new features and explains what it’s taken to get them ready.",
                  "fontSize": "15px",
                  "fontFamily": {
                    "label": "Helvetica",
                    "value": "helvetica,sans-serif"
                  },
                  "color": "#333333",
                  "textAlign": "left",
                  "lineHeight": "160%",
                  "containerPadding": "8px 32px 16px"
                }
              },
